version: 2.0.0
description: >
  The public hero pages GitHub Pages serves: a hub and one page each for Paradigm, Gnomon, Warpline
  and the learning path. Plain static files, complete from file:// with scripting off, with no request
  to any other origin. Every number is stamped into the committed HTML from facts.json; nothing numeric
  is typed by hand. Design system: .atelier/systems/pages/. Built so far: the hub, the Paradigm page
  and the 404. Gnomon, Warpline and Learn are listed in build/pages.json as not built yet.

components:
  pages-stamp:
    description: >-
      build/stamp.mjs. Rewrites the stamped regions of each page (facts, source lines, standing ledgers,
      file excerpts at the pinned commit, command captures, lately rows, the symbol graph, the shared
      head, masthead and footer) from facts.json. --check fails when a page is out of date; --release
      also refuses slots, facts without a source or date, standing rows without evidence and excerpts
      that stop inside a list.
    type: build
    tags: [site, build, facts]
  pages-check:
    description: >-
      build/check.mjs. Fails on a custom property that is not a foundation value in the design system,
      light and dark token sets that differ, an undeclared var(), a symbol hue outside a sigil, a digit
      in page text that was not stamped, an unresolved token or visible slot in a release, an excerpt
      that ends inside a list, a request to another origin, a dead internal link, and a file over its
      size budget. Runs its planted failures first on every run.
    type: build
    tags: [site, build, design-system]
  pages-frame:
    description: >-
      assets/pages.css and assets/pages.js. One stylesheet and one deferred script shared by every page:
      tokens in light and dark (by prefers-color-scheme and by the theme key), masthead, key, command
      line, prompt line, standing, fact line, before and after, paired table, proof excerpt, ledger,
      numbered rows, lately, footer. The script adds the theme key, the Copy keys and the graph ripple;
      a page is complete without it.
    type: view
    tags: [site, ui]
  pages-hub:
    description: index.html. The overview - what Paradigm is, one lead fact, the index of the three products and the path, how they fit, the last releases, where each stands.
    type: view
    tags: [site, ui]
  pages-paradigm:
    description: paradigm/index.html. Seven sections - hero with the symbol graph plate, the three claims, what has been measured, one session, lately, the standing ledger with limits, and the first thing to do.
    type: view
    tags: [site, ui]
  pages-symbol-graph:
    description: >-
      The Paradigm plate. stamp.mjs reads two features from packages/paradigm/.purpose at the pinned
      commit and draws them as an inline SVG whose nodes are focusable symbol ids; hover or focus ripples
      to the node's dependents. The stamp fails if the captured paradigm ripple answer does not name the
      same symbols. Below 620px the same symbols and edges are a nested list.
    type: view
    tags: [site, ui, graph]
